{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ninja boy and Yo-kai s a\u00a02D exploration-based platform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Japan's Sengoku period, join the protagonist, Jin, on a journey through the small nation of Mizuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jin, a young boy in ninja training, lived a peaceful life, spending his days honing his skills and playing with his childhood friend, Princess Sakurano. But after being awakened by a sudden explosion, Jin realizes something is terribly wrong in his village. Dark clouds loom over the castle, and hordes of yokai suddenly appear. A mysterious ninja even kills Jin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having gained the power to travel between the world of the dead, &quot;Toko-yo,&quot; and the living world, &quot;Utsutsu,&quot; Jin uses his &quot;Toko-yo Watari&quot; ability to journey alone toward the castle where Sakurano is. Can Jin restore peace to his village?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a jump-action game where you defeat yokai with your trusty kunai. Unlock skills like mid-air dashes and double jumps to expand your range of exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/630c4caf0067173d8d9de4eb7d486760.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/630c4caf0067173d8d9de4eb7d486760.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/630c4caf0067173d8d9de4eb7d486760.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your kunai into walls to create footholds and expand your exploration range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/7e6f977931eb183010ff5662e01c604c.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/7e6f977931eb183010ff5662e01c604c.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/7e6f977931eb183010ff5662e01c604c.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your &quot;Toko-yo Watari&quot; ability to stop time, avoid traps, and fight terrifying yokai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/f89d675542543fad1b64e4053215771b.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/f89d675542543fad1b64e4053215771b.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/f89d675542543fad1b64e4053215771b.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've aimed for smooth, responsive, and satisfying action that reacts instantly to player input!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/1a90be4477d9be8b5f94162a78890541.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/1a90be4477d9be8b5f94162a78890541.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/1a90be4477d9be8b5f94162a78890541.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Instant Action:</strong> Actions have no cooldown or startup frames, and movement reaches max speed instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coyote Time:</strong> You can still jump for a brief moment after walking off a platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Input Buffering:</strong> Your action will still be performed even if you press the button slightly too early.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ledge Correction:</strong> You can climb small ledges even if your jump doesn't quite reach, and you'll automatically vault over small bumps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've made many other adjustments to create a satisfying feel! We've dedicated a lot of time to the fundamentals of what makes a great action game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976660?t=1772726761","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976660?t=1772726761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/1d1113e930a3f83ada890458d77c12313ef6001f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772726761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/1d1113e930a3f83ada890458d77c12313ef6001f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772726761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ninja boy and Yo-kai s a\u00a02D exploration-based platform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Japan's Sengoku period, join the protagonist, Jin, on a journey through the small nation of Mizuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jin, a young boy in ninja training, lived a peaceful life, spending his days honing his skills and playing with his childhood friend, Princess Sakurano. But after being awakened by a sudden explosion, Jin realizes something is terribly wrong in his village. Dark clouds loom over the castle, and hordes of yokai suddenly appear. A mysterious ninja even kills Jin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having gained the power to travel between the world of the dead, &quot;Toko-yo,&quot; and the living world, &quot;Utsutsu,&quot; Jin uses his &quot;Toko-yo Watari&quot; ability to journey alone toward the castle where Sakurano is. Can Jin restore peace to his village?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a jump-action game where you defeat yokai with your trusty kunai. Unlock skills like mid-air dashes and double jumps to expand your range of exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/630c4caf0067173d8d9de4eb7d486760.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/630c4caf0067173d8d9de4eb7d486760.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/630c4caf0067173d8d9de4eb7d486760.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your kunai into walls to create footholds and expand your exploration range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/7e6f977931eb183010ff5662e01c604c.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/7e6f977931eb183010ff5662e01c604c.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/7e6f977931eb183010ff5662e01c604c.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your &quot;Toko-yo Watari&quot; ability to stop time, avoid traps, and fight terrifying yokai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/f89d675542543fad1b64e4053215771b.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/f89d675542543fad1b64e4053215771b.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/f89d675542543fad1b64e4053215771b.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've aimed for smooth, responsive, and satisfying action that reacts instantly to player input!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/1a90be4477d9be8b5f94162a78890541.poster.avif?t=1772726761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/1a90be4477d9be8b5f94162a78890541.webm?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/extras/1a90be4477d9be8b5f94162a78890541.mp4?t=1772726761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Instant Action:</strong> Actions have no cooldown or startup frames, and movement reaches max speed instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coyote Time:</strong> You can still jump for a brief moment after walking off a platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Input Buffering:</strong> Your action will still be performed even if you press the button slightly too early.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ledge Correction:</strong> You can climb small ledges even if your jump doesn't quite reach, and you'll automatically vault over small bumps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've made many other adjustments to create a satisfying feel! We've dedicated a lot of time to the fundamentals of what makes a great action game.</p>","developers":["\u30ad\u30e3\u30b9"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976660/e2264608e971a0b56e01a385ac56bc45f2936089/header.jpg?t=1772726761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976660/1711957389/2c571390374f6013f32f851c65b4bf29b097294a/1755920103/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756872034","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976660/1711957389/2c571390374f6013f32f851c65b4bf29b097294a/1755920103/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756872034","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976660/1711957389/2c571390374f6013f32f851c65b4bf29b097294a/1755920103/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756872034","id":257187500,"name":"Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187500/37adcb93d44566300fb16db91d29b4f2e028ecd6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756872034"}],"name":"Ninja boy and Yo-kai",